{
  "_comment": [
    "Flash is played with the keyboard and the mouse a desktop already has,",
    "so the default is the identity: every key drives the key of the same",
    "name, and the mouse drives the mouse. The user's own bindings always win.",
    "Mouse position is bound window-relative (WMouse), because a Flash movie",
    "is handed stage coordinates and the stage IS the window here."
  ],
